"activate upon entering the directory. Supports POSIX shells and fish."
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-zed.md:610
msgid ""
"`direct`: Use `direnv export json` to load direnv. This will load direnv "
"directly without relying on the shell hook and might cause some "
"inconsistencies. This allows direnv to work with any shell."
msgstr ""

#: src/configuring-zed.md:611
msgid ""
"`disabled`: No shell environment will be loaded automatically; direnv must "
"be invoked manually (e.g. with `direnv exec`) to be used."
msgstr ""

